OL,3,GNEWSASir Tom Jones to headline Blenheim
OL,4,APalace Festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Tom Jones has been announced as the
OL,7,F5th headliner of Oxfordshire's Blenheim
OL,8,FPalace Festival 2027, with Nile Rodgers
OL,9,F& CHIC joining him as special guests.
OL,11,FThe Palace in Woodstock will host 5
OL,12,Fnights of music in June and July next
OL,13,Fyear, with performances from headliners
OL,14,FMariah Carey, Shania Twain, Alex Warren
OL,15,Fand David Gray.
OL,17,FHeather Carter, managing director of
OL,18,Fvisitor attraction at Blenheim Palace,
OL,19,Fsaid it will be an "unforgettable night
OL,20,Ffor fans", as "they're both true
OL,21,Fmusical icons", looking ahead to a
OL,22,F"very special evening of music."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
